Package: supercamera-yuyv-dkms
Version: @VERSION@-1
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms (>= 3.0.11)
Recommends: linux-headers-generic, v4l-utils
Maintainer: KlumpRasmus
Homepage: https://github.com/KlumpRasmus/supercamera-yuyv-linux
Description: DKMS V4L2 driver for 2ce3:3828 SuperCamera YUYV endoscope
 Experimental out-of-tree V4L2 driver for the Geek/Szitman SuperCamera USB
 endoscope variant exposing interface 0, bulk endpoints 0x82/0x02, and a
 320x240 YUYV video stream. DKMS rebuilds the module for new kernels.
